  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tajikistan Water Supply and Sanitation Single-Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objectives of the Trust Fund is to co-finance the IDA-funded Tajikistan Water Supply and Sanitation Investment Project (the Project) (P177325).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives of the project and the TF are (i) to improve access to safely-managed water supply services in selected districts of Khatlon region; (ii) and to strengthen the capacity of institutions in the water supply and sanitation sector for improved service delivery.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
